{"sections":[{"slug":"Atiyah–Bott不动点定理","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Atiyah–Bott不动点定理"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“Atiyah–Bott <span lang=\"zh\">不动点定理</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“Atiyah–Bott 不动点定理”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>Atiyah–Bott <span lang=\"zh\">不动点定理是</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Lefschetz不动点定理","text":"Lefschetz <span lang=\"zh\">不动点定理</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">在</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/椭圆复形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">椭圆复形</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">上的推广</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">其</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/deRham复形","text":"de Rham <span lang=\"zh\">复形</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的特例是</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Lefschetz不动点定理","text":"Lefschetz <span lang=\"zh\">不动点定理</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>$f\\colon M\\to M$ <span lang=\"zh\">是光滑映射</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">满足</span> $f$ <span lang=\"zh\">的图像与</span> $M\\times M$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的对角线</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/横截","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">横截</span>"}},{"Plain":". <span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $E_j$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/椭圆复形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">椭圆复形</span>"}},{"Plain":", $\\varphi_j\\colon f^*E_j\\to E_j$ <span lang=\"zh\">诱导其自同态</span> $T$,\n$$\r\nT_i =\\Gamma(E_i) \\overset{-\\circ f}{\\to}\\Gamma(f^*E_i)\\overset{\\varphi_i}{\\to}\\Gamma(E_i).\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">那么</span> Atiyah–Bott <span lang=\"zh\">不动点定理表明</span>\n$$\r\nL(T) = \\sum_{x\\,\\text{fixed}}\\frac{1}{\\det (1-Df)}\\sum_j(-1)^j\\operatorname{tr}_x(\\varphi_j),\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">其中</span>\n$$\r\nL(T)=\\sum_i (-1)^i\\operatorname{tr}(T_i^*\\colon H^i\\to H^i)\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">是推广的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Lefschetz数","text":"Lefschetz <span lang=\"zh\">数</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}}]}